| `KEEL_REQUIRED_EXTRAS` | string | unset; CI sets `template,dev,transport,secrets` | comma-separated surfaces from `tests/optional_deps.py` `SURFACES` | `tests/optional_deps.py`; `.github/workflows/ci.yml` | Turns a listed surface's skip into a hard failure, so a broken install cannot pass; `config/project.json` `child_env.names` lists it, so it reaches the `test` goal `make verify` runs through `scripts/gate_evidence.py`. | a surface kept optional on purpose, such as `langgraph` | always |
